## Testing Requirements

### Deployment Validation
Both scripts MUST include comprehensive validation:

```sql
-- Multi-source data validation
SELECT 
    'Epic' as source_system,
    COUNT(DISTINCT patient_id) as patient_count,
    COUNT(DISTINCT encounter_id) as encounter_count
FROM EPIC.PATIENTS p 
LEFT JOIN EPIC.ENCOUNTERS e ON p.patient_id = e.patient_id

UNION ALL

SELECT 
    'Financial Integration' as source_system,
    COUNT(DISTINCT patient_id) as patient_count,
    COUNT(DISTINCT encounter_id) as encounter_count
FROM ORACLE_ERP.ENCOUNTER_FINANCIALS

UNION ALL

SELECT 
    'Engagement Integration' as source_system, 
    COUNT(DISTINCT patient_id) as patient_count,
    0 as encounter_count
FROM SALESFORCE.PATIENT_PORTAL_ACTIVITY;
```

## Manual SnowCLI Operations

### Standard Connection Pattern
For manual troubleshooting and verification during deployment:

```bash
# Standard SnowCLI command structure
snow sql -q "YOUR_QUERY_HERE;" \
  --account SFSENORTHAMERICA-DEMO_JAKERS \
  --user TCH_PATIENT_360_USER \
  --role TCH_PATIENT_360_ROLE \
  --database TCH_PATIENT_360_POC \
  --warehouse TCH_COMPUTE_WH
```

### Authentication Setup
```bash
# Password authentication (set environment variable)
export SNOWFLAKE_PASSWORD=your_password

# Keypair authentication (add flag)
--private-key-path keypair/rsa_key.p8
```

### Deployment Verification Commands
```bash
# Verify all source systems data loaded
snow sql -q "
SELECT 'EPIC.PATIENTS' as table_name, COUNT(*) as row_count FROM EPIC.PATIENTS
UNION ALL SELECT 'ORACLE_ERP.ENCOUNTER_FINANCIALS', COUNT(*) FROM ORACLE_ERP.ENCOUNTER_FINANCIALS
UNION ALL SELECT 'SALESFORCE.PATIENT_PORTAL_ACTIVITY', COUNT(*) FROM SALESFORCE.PATIENT_PORTAL_ACTIVITY
ORDER BY table_name;" \
  --account SFSENORTHAMERICA-DEMO_JAKERS \
  --user TCH_PATIENT_360_USER \
  --role TCH_PATIENT_360_ROLE \
  --database TCH_PATIENT_360_POC \
  --warehouse TCH_COMPUTE_WH

# Check Dynamic Tables status
snow sql -q "SELECT table_name, target_lag, last_refresh_time FROM INFORMATION_SCHEMA.TABLES WHERE table_type = 'DYNAMIC TABLE';" \
  --account SFSENORTHAMERICA-DEMO_JAKERS \
  --user TCH_PATIENT_360_USER \
  --role TCH_PATIENT_360_ROLE \
  --database TCH_PATIENT_360_POC \
  --warehouse TCH_COMPUTE_WH
```

